<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns TEPCO shelf registration AA+ rating.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns TEPCO shelf registration AA+ rating.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Monday that it had assigned a preliminary AA+ rating to Tokyo Electric Power Co Inc's (TEPCO) 1.5 trillion yen shelf registration programme on the Japanese market.</p>
<p>This was a renewal of the 2.2 trillion yen shelf registration programme which expired on October 25, 1996, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
<p>The rating outlook is stable, S&amp;P said.</p>
</text>
